      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>question about 'outpaced' and 'Missionaries Arrive' question.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>'outpaced' dahan event is '&nbsp;Raids in Force: Each Spirit chooses a differend land where Dahan outnumber Town / City. Each Dahan there does 1 Damage.'</p>\r\n\r\n<p>this is 'dahan damage to town/city'? or 'event card damage to dahan'?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>'Missionaries Arrive' second option is 'During the next normal Ravage, City do +3 Damage.'</p>\r\n\r\n<p>this is 'During the next normal Ravage, when every now ravage&nbsp;each&nbsp;city&nbsp;each&nbsp;6 damage to dahan and land'?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
